DESCRIPTION:Meet The Iotas. The Zeta Chapter of Iota Phi Theta Fraternity\
 , Inc. is planning "Pride vs. Props: What They Don’t Tell You About Greek
  Life"\, an interactive web seminar and candid conversation designed for 
 male students looking to build a lasting legacy on campus and beyond. Get
  to know the brothers of the Zeta Chapter and engage in a real talk on Gr
 eek life\, the history and founding principles of Iota Phi Theta (Scholar
 ship\, Leadership\, Citizenship\, Fidelity\, and Brotherhood)\, and what 
 it truly means to find your own lane rather than following the crowd.\n\n
 Hosted by: Iota Phi Theta Fraternity\, Inc.\n\nAdditional Information can
  be found at: https://1891connect.ncat.edu/event/12975088
