BEGIN:VEVENT
CATEGORIES:ThoughtfulLearning
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a festive fusion of creativity\, engineering\, and
  holiday cheer at Santa’s Sleigh Sweepers! This hands-on STEAM adventure 
 invites young learners to step into Santa’s workshop and help design\, bu
 ild\, and test robotic solutions that keep the sleigh running smoothly fo
 r its big night.\nParticipants will rotate through imaginative exploratio
 n stations where they will: Build and code holiday‑themed robots to compl
 ete merry missions. Navigate snowy obstacle courses that challenge precis
 ion\, logic\, and teamwork. Tackle engineering design tasks inspired by S
 anta’s seasonal challenges. Explore real-world STEAM concepts through pla
 yful\, winter‑wonderland activities\nThroughout the event\, learners will
  engage in authentic STEAM practices including computational thinking\, c
 reative problem‑solving\, engineering design\, and data exploration. Whet
 her they’re programming a robot to deliver presents\, designing a sleigh‑
 repair solution\, or discovering how sensors help robots “see” in a snowy
  environment\, participants will experience the joy of innovation wrapped
  in holiday magic.\nPerfect for learners ages 3–12\, Santa’s Sleigh Sweep
 ers blends imagination with engineering to spark curiosity\, confidence\,
  and festive fun.\n\nHosted by: College of Education STEAM Lab\n\nAdditio
 nal Information can be found at: https://1891connect.ncat.edu/event/12781
 447
